  "description": "Resolves an amateur radio callsign to its ADIF DXCC entity code using the Big CTY country file, and keeps that file up to date. The country file is compiled in, so lookups work from startup and never depend on the network; a hosted service then refreshes it in the background by conditional GET. Handles compound callsigns (which side of the stroke says where the station is), operating suffixes, receiver labels and the KG4 rule. Extracted from the pskr2mqtt PSK Reporter ingester.",
